to/31/2ECL/0H21LC9FA5591B721827C9px.webp","time":"2026-05-04T12:40:01+08:00","caption":"時令水果雞尾酒","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0a2Mr01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V26ABD3A1A2B620DCFCpx.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:53:22+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0VWIr01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V25FAE66800E7284F7Fpx.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:53:22+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0VGIr01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1Q0DDBEBAEEF12A3B7px.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:46+08:00","caption":"以閉月羞花利口酒為基底，建議配薑汽水，亦可配上湯力水或梳打水。花果香氣與草本韻味交織，氣泡清新，酸甜平衡，帶來優雅細膩的口感。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0RWIr01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1PD59B2F427CE056FEpx.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:46+08:00","caption":"以五味雜陳利口酒為基底，配上湯力水、梳打或可樂，簡單卻層次分明。草本香氣中帶微甜回甘，清爽易飲，適合隨時隨地輕鬆享用。","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0RGIr01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1OEC76DD04825BE4C8px.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:46+08:00","caption":"「西洋菜蜜」是港式冰室與茶餐廳的清潤代表——以西洋菜煲水取其清香微草本，調入蜜糖。清甜不膩、潤喉解膩，熱飲暖胃，凍飲消暑。 ​ 作為一杯消暑雞尾酒，入口先見青瓜","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0R0Ir01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1N32B37A0A3CAA8E7Epx.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:46+08:00","caption":"「凍齋啡」是港式冰室對無奶無糖的冰黑咖啡之稱——「齋啡」即黑咖啡。爽利苦韻、直來直往，曾是無數打工仔的醒神日常。 以「五味雜陳」的草本層次為靈魂，這款雞尾酒入口","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0QmIr01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1M433FC76A9EDAC8ACpx.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:45+08:00","caption":"「唂咕」這個名字源自粵語對 可可 (Cocoa) 的俏皮讀音，帶點童趣，也勾起不少人對港式飲品與甜品的回憶。早年香港的冰室、茶餐廳常供應朱古力奶、咖啡加忌廉等甜","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0QWIr01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1LC55D154BF8BA123Dpx.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:45+08:00","caption":"「凍檸賓」源自香港茶餐廳文化，是幾代人共同的夏日記憶。原版飲品以 利賓納 (Ribena) 黑加侖子糖漿加入冰水或梳打，再擠上新鮮檸檬汁，酸甜清爽，既解渴又帶點","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0QGIr01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1KC65741E65BD4B94Apx.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:45+08:00","caption":"取材自經典長島冰茶的概念，並非以六種烈酒調製，而是匯合六款東西方草本利口酒，展現層次繁複而深邃的草本風味。猶如傳統的「廿四味」涼茶，以眾多藥草調和熬製，既帶苦韻","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0Q0Ir01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1J39D029FCE2E92514px.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:45+08:00","caption":"以話梅浸泡氈酒作為基底，帶來複雜而鹹鮮的層次。再加入「閉月羞花」與蒙特內哥羅苦酒，進一步突顯草本香氣。酸甜之間帶微鹹，餘韻悠長，是一款極具特色的中式風味雞尾酒—","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0PmIr01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1I5091C5024E89DED8px.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:45+08:00","caption":"我們將涼茶文化融入雞尾酒，以緻月五花茶氈酒為基底，結合五味雜陳與閉月羞花的東方草本風味，再配上蓍草利口酒的微苦層次，讓傳統涼茶化身現代酒館的特色雞尾酒 —— 在","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0PWIr01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1HC0C079F4C4A9FC0Dpx.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:45+08:00","caption":"清新爽口的柑桔香氣，酸甜微鹹之間帶出層次感。五味雜陳的草本底韻與無名氏珍稀氈酒的澄澈柑橘相互交織，再以柑桔蜜圓潤收口，配上梳打水的氣泡感，令人聯想起香港懷舊的鹹","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0PGIr01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2EBO/0H1V1G4AFDCDAF2E0F7E3Dpx.webp","time":"2026-05-02T08:48:45+08:00","caption":"涼茶雞尾酒","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0P0Ir01"},{"full":"https://static5.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2E75/0H0YWCC98BCDDD3FD44BD6px.webp","time":"2026-04-26T01:39:04+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0h66q01"},{"full":"https://static8.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2E75/0H0YWB63DDA174E3175A57px.webp","time":"2026-04-26T01:39:04+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0gs6q01"},{"full":"https://static7.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2E75/0H0YWA7514732FC68AEC6Apx.webp","time":"2026-04-26T01:39:04+08:00","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0gc6q01"},{"full":"https://static6.orstatic.com/userphoto3/photo/31/2E75/0H0YW95C36D281DA98250Apx.webp","time":"2026-04-26T01:39:04+08:00","caption":"酸梅湯","source":"https://s.openrice.com/QrbJ0gM6q01"}],"food_total":24}